OL,3,GNEWSAMum grateful for personal apology
OL,4,Aover missing stillborn son
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother who has campaigned for more
OL,7,Fthan 50 years to find her stillborn son
OL,8,Fsaid her baby "did not die in vain"
OL,9,Fafter receiving a personal government
OL,10,Fapology in a call from the health
OL,11,Fsecretary.
OL,13,FGina Jacobs, of Greasby, Wirral, did
OL,14,Fnot learn where her son Robert had been
OL,15,Fburied until 53 years after his
OL,16,Fstillbirth in 1969.
OL,18,FMore than 1,000 infants were buried in
OL,19,Funmarked graves across Wirral and a
OL,20,Fmass burial ground in Oldham, Greater
OL,21,FManchester, also contained more than
OL,22,F270 babies.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
